+`ba2cbbf09d4978f416e0ebd1fceeebc2c4138c05` and Lake 5.0.0, exactly matching
+the lock and manifest. Full shim source, hashes, diagnosis, and smoke output
+are in `evidence/18-sandbox-toolchain-compatibility.log`.
